<title>SRI LANKA: Asia Capital offers to buy Vanik Incorporation.</title>
<headline>Asia Capital offers to buy Vanik Incorporation.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asia Capital Ltd said on Tuesday it had made an offer for the entire issued capital of Vanik Incorporation Ltd, an investment bank.</p>
<p>In an announcement made on the floor of the stock exchange, Asia Capital said it had offered to buy all the issued shares of Vanik Incorporation Limited as at November 11, on the basis of 10 rupees in cash and one new share of Asia Capital for each of Vanik's more than 40 million shares.</p>
</text>
